{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1508127-lets-design-a-sorcerous-working-or-a-slew-of-them-aimed-at-improving-shipboard-life","id":1508127,"title":"Lets design a sorcerous working or a slew of them aimed at improving shipboard life","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-04-12T01:15:20-07:00","id":1508127,"title":"Lets design a sorcerous working or a slew of them aimed at improving shipboard life","content":"a niche case but I think its worth examining <br /> <br /> If we just want to improve fishing if we want to farm on the ship,","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T02:27:39-07:00","id":1508129,"title":"","content":"Create a species of plant that can replace the sails, which regularly grows fruit that can stave off scurvy?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-12T03:59:42-07:00","id":1508134,"title":"","content":"A pack of giant magical spiders that make sails out of their web, do much of the maintenance and angling of the sails and some bit of fishing with nets to boot.<br /> <br /> Now that i thought of that, a sorcerer might just summon a variety of Anuhles and train them in taking up much of the work of the crew for it.<br /> In fact, one could take things <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ballooning_(spider)\" target=\"_blank\">even farther</a>, i guess.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1508127-lets-design-a-sorcerous-working-or-a-slew-of-them-aimed-at-improving-shipboard-life?p=1508129#post1508129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Create a species of plant that can replace the sails, which regularly grows fruit that can stave off scurvy?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200bOh wait, if one uses some variant of wood spider elementals instead the sorcerer could even combine both ideas in a tree-ship of sorts with a crew of spider-fruit or something similar to boot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 04-12-2023, 07:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-13T15:03:27-07:00","id":1508302,"title":"","content":"Had actually looked at mixing greenmaw and mercury ants to create kind of a tiny cleaning and maintenance crew for my ship that could be used for breaking down and consuming waste and debris and using it to create small patches to the ship.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-14T07:51:47-07:00","id":1508359,"title":"","content":"A working to keep rodents and barnacles away would be reasonable. Low ambition, but possibly needing a bit of finesse.<br /> <br /> A working to slow down the decay of the wood and male it somewhat harder might be good, once again I can see it messed up with low finesse (now your ship is heavy as stone or can propagate cracks like stone).<br /> <br /> While not a working, creating an elemental to help get your ship to its destination seems to be one of the most straightforward uses for the summon elemental spell.<br /> <br /> A working to reduce the resistance of ship moving forward in the water would be useful, but if the working reduced the resistance in all directions, then the ship would be blown about by the wind unable to control its movement.<br /> <br /> A working to repel arrows and stones.<br /> <br /> A working so that the bilge of the ship constantly pumps itself dry would be appreciated.<br /> <br /> A working to desalinate water, or collect rainwater, so the ship could make those long trips to and from the west without having to haul so much fresh water with it would be useful, although this might be more appropriate as an artifact.<br /> <br /> A working to make the inside of the ship bigger than the outside, ideally allowing the ship to hold more cargo without losing the ship's buoyancy, (or even not adjusting for buoyancy - just giving everyone more space without allowing more weight).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I want to play <a href=\"https://forum.atlas-games.com/t/adelbert-a-magi-of-hermes-look-at-intellego-and-astrology/8146/382\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> as a starting character, I don't even care what game.","edited":{"userid":872,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","user":"Apromor","date":". 04-14-2023, 09:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/872-apromor","name":"Apromor","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar872_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-15T22:56:51-07:00","id":1508512,"title":"","content":"oh ideas on distinction between a working on one ship and an entire fleet","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a hre